          "content": [
            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "text": "The 定稿 (R3) shows a \"C\" shape with gap opening to the left. Current R43 has gap opening to the right.\n\nSo the answer: 定稿的缺口朝左；当前稿朝右。\n\nLet me be careful about the mirror. R3's gap is on the left side (the opening between the two tips is on the left). R43's gap is on the right side.\n\nAlso, I should check whether there are textual notes about direction (方向识别 group G7 mentions 方向识别). But the question is simple. Maybe worth checking brief notes? The vista_history_expand of target group only returned labels, no notes. Let's perhaps read R5 group? Not necessary.\n\nAnswer: 定稿缺口朝左（当前稿朝右，属于镜像/相反方向）。\n\nShould I mention confidence? I'll describe."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我对比了「定稿」和当前稿两版，**两版方向相反**：\n\n| 版本 | 缺口朝向 |\n|---|---|\n| **R3 · 泊位图标 · 定稿**（保存的定稿） | **朝左** ⬅ |\n| R43 · 泊位图标 · 当前稿 | 朝右 ➡ |\n\n也就是说，我们保存的定稿缺口**朝左**（开口在左侧，弧体主体在右），而你现在看的这版当前稿缺口朝右，相当于定稿的水平镜像。\n\n如果这版当前稿是打算替换定稿的，需要确认方向是否真的需要改；从「泊位方向识别」这组（G7）看，朝向是刻意区分过的属性，若不需要翻转，当前稿应镜像回来。"
            }
          ],
